  "referenceNumber": "RUS2279",
  "remarks": "\nDavor Dragolobovic SAVICIC is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following ground: SAVICIC is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine \nbecause he engages in policies and actions which \ndestabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n",
